<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18652] CdcMain is not committing state during index rebuilding</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18652</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For persistent cluster CdcMain is not committing state during index rebuilding if there are no data updates.&lt;br/&gt;
It can cause to sharp increase of cdc WAL-archive size in case of big indexes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is a reproducer patch:  &lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13054862/13054862_CdcRebuildTest.patch&quot; title=&quot;CdcRebuildTest.patch attached to IGNITE-18652&quot;&gt;CdcRebuildTest.patch&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
